# Dxun, the jungle landing (TSL, 003EBO, 401DXN): the galaxy map to
# Onderon, Atton's blockade talk and Colonel Tobin's hail (attond), the run
# for the jungle moon (no turret: "I'll man the turret" loads 421DXN's
# minigame, left out), the reception aboard on Dxun (ond_rece: Onderon
# asked after, Kreia's outpost; Atton stays with the Hawk), ashore with
# Mira and Bao-Dur, the Zhug bounty hunters' camp on the far path: Dezanti
# asked who he is, Mira backed against him (+INF, DSimpson's "a real
# bounty hunter"), no surrender and the Duros fought, their camp's
# containers searched, and on into the jungle (402DXN).
# Starts from Nar Shaddaa's last checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_done data/routes/tsl/dxun_landing.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Onderon / Dxun" and "Dxun Jungle, Ebon Hawk
# Area" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: the turret minigame (600 XP), the three remote droids and the
# droid carrier's rusted computer port (Repair parts, Computer spikes), the
# skeletal corpses past the boma and maalraas on the side path.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - @nar_shaddaa_done stands aboard the Ebon Hawk (003EBO) with the galaxy
#   map in reach; Onderon (planetary.2da row 7) selectable, Dxun (row 1)
#   not; 401DXN_Visited and 401DXN_STARTED both 0, so k_sup_galaxymap
#   takes the first trip to Onderon as the blockade (OndScn01, 003EBO
#   reloaded at WP_PC_WALK_MAP).
# - Mira (NPC 7) and Bao-Dur (NPC 1) available. Kreia and Atton aboard;
#   Atton keeps the ship.
# - UNSURE: attond starts by itself when 003EBO is reloaded (its start 0
#   has no speaker gate but c_local_set); if not, `use Atton` first.
# - UNSURE: tr_leave shows the party screen on the first Dxun landing (as
#   Dantooine's did), and Atton is not offered on it.
# - UNSURE: whether the chain killed Zhugs on Nar Shaddaa (c_zhugkilled):
#   then Dezanti opens with start 0 ("I doubt you will do any better than
#   your brothers"), the Mira lines are never offered and the says below
#   go unused; the fight comes either way.
use Galaxymap
travel 7             # Onderon (planetary.2da): the blockade, 003EBO again
say We'd better run for it. To the moon. # not the turret (a_to_421dxn)
talk                 # Atton (attond): Tobin's hail, the hits, the movies
say We need to get to Onderon. # the reception (ond_rece, a_dxun_cs)
say Let's head to the outpost, then.
talk
party 7,1            # Mira (the Zhugs) and Bao-Dur (Kumus)
to tr_leave          # the ramp: the party screen, accepted
module 401dxn
say =Who are you?    # Dezanti Zhug (tr_zhugtalk): on the way Atton's two
say You really think you can take on Mira? # reports, Mira's mines (+INF)
say There's no way I'm going to surrender to you.
to tr_zhugtalk
talk
fight 30             # Dezanti and his two brothers (duros_bh)
use zhug_chest       # the Zhugs' camp
use GroundBagMetalCase
use MilHighPlstcCylin
exit To_402          # into the jungle
module 402dxn
save dxun_jungle
